id: pm-z20n3s
title: Retain original dependency advisory receipts on release workflow failures
description: "Auto Release run39713092159 fails at the dependency advisory collector, but its only retained artifact is release-observation-1 (317 bytes). The original per-feed receipt is unavailable, so the failure cannot be independently classified as a positive advisory versus an unavailable feed. CI receipt retention is already completed and works: artifact12398397190 for the matching PR failure proves registry unavailable and OSV complete across568 versions with zero findings. Extend that successful scoped evidence pattern to every release path that can call the advisory gate; preserve all gate outcomes and privacy boundaries. See https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1542."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-22T04:11:22.309Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T09:02:53.151Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-22T09:02:52.356Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-22T09:02:52.356Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: Retain the exact public dependency receipt when an applicable release gate succeeds or fails; Bound hidden-file upload to that single inspected receipt and distinguish run attempts; Keep raw stderr credentials telemetry and unrelated caches excluded; Demonstrate positive unavailable and clean outcomes retain their original strict gate verdicts
parent: pm-ciadvisoryreceipt
risk: medium
confidence: 100
resolution: "Auto Release and Release always upload only the original public dependency receipt after the applicable gate, with explicit hidden-file inclusion, run/attempt identity, seven-day retention and warning-only missing-file handling."
expected_result: "Successful and refused release gates retain the exact public registry/OSV evidence without exposing raw stderr, credentials, telemetry or sibling caches and without weakening security admission."
actual_result: "Both new workflow contracts fail before the change and pass afterward; strict clean/positive/unavailable feed controls and all26 required checks pass on8b9c33517, with11001 hosted tests and exact100/100/100/100 coverage. Final closure-head review and admission remain required before merge."
